// Gross Debt
// Table: Balance Sheet
// Display folder: 02-kpi
// Format: #,##0
// Hidden: false
// Long-Term Debt (noncurrent) + Long-Term Debt Current. Excludes operating lease liabilities (see [Operating Lease Liabilities]). BLANK current portion counts as 0; BLANK when noncurrent debt is BLANK.

Gross Debt =
VAR _lt = [Long-Term Debt]
VAR _cur = [Long-Term Debt Current]
RETURN
IF(ISBLANK(_lt), BLANK(), _lt + COALESCE(_cur, 0))
